==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{etymon|ru|:inh|sla-pro:*ne}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*ne}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*ne}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*né}}. Cognates include {{cog|lt|ne}}, {{cog|ang|ne}}, {{cog|de|nicht}}, {{m|de|nie}}, {{cog|got|𐌽𐌹}}, {{cog|ga|ní}}, {{cog|la|ne}}, {{cog|sa|न|tr=ná}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{qualifier|unstressed}} {{ru-IPA}}
* {{qualifier|stressed}} {{ru-IPA|не́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-не.ogg}}
* {{homophones|ru|ни}} {{qualifier|when unstressed}}

===Particle===
{{head|ru|particle}}

# {{qualifier|negative in full}} [[not]], [[no]], [[-n't]], [[without]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] '''не''' [[знать|зна́ет]]|t=He does [[not]] [[know]].}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''не''' [[долететь|долете́в]] [[до]] [[цель|це́ли]]|t=without having reached the target}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он]] '''не''' [[ге́ний]]|t=he is no genius}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Не''' [[делать|де́лай]] [[этот|э́того]]!|t=Don’t do it!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Не''' [[говорить|говори́]] [[ни]] [[слово|сло́ва]]!|t=don’t say a word!}}
# Idiomatic negative usage
#: {{uxi|ru|([[я|мне]]) [[не по себе́|'''не''' по себе́]]|t=(I) feel sick; (I) feel uncomfortable}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не раз|'''не''' раз]]|t=more than once (literary: not once); time and again; repeatedly; many a time}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[видеть|ви́дел]] [[вы|вас]] [[не раз|'''не''' раз]].|t=I have seen you often.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[тем не ме́нее|тем '''не''' ме́нее]]|t=nevertheless}}
# {{qualifier|partial negative}} [[perhaps]] [[not]], [[whether]] ... [[or]] [[not]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[счастье|Сча́стье]] '''не''' [[сча́стье]], [[но]] [[что́-то]] [[похожий|похо́жее]].|t=Perhaps not happiness, but something very much like it.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[хотеть|Хо́чешь]] '''не''' [[хотеть|хо́чешь]], [[а]] [[прийтись|придётся]] [[сде́лать]].|t=like it or not, you’ll have to do it.}}
# [[will]] [[never]] {{qualifier|implying impossibility to do something}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Ему́ [[этот|э́того]] '''не''' [[сде́лать]].|t=He will never do it.}}
# {{gloss|usually not translated, gives affirmative meaning for expression, especially in exclamations}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[какой|Како́й]] [[ру́сский]] '''не''' [[любить|лю́бит]] [[быстрый|бы́строй]] [[езда|езды́]]!|t=What Russian doesn't like fast driving!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[кто|Кто]] '''не''' [[любить|лю́бит]] [[пое́сть]]!|t=Who doesn't like a good meal!}}

====Usage notes====
{{lang|ru|''не''}} sometimes appears stressed, e.g. in the past negative of {{m|ru|быть||to be}}, where the forms appear as {{l|ru|[[не́]] [[быть|был]]}}, {{l|ru|[[не]] [[быть|была́]]}}, {{l|ru|[[не́]] [[быть|было]]}}, {{l|ru|[[не́]] [[быть|были]]}} (i.e. {{lang|ru|''не''}} is stressed in the masculine singular, the neuter singular and the plural, but not the feminine singular).

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix}} {{attention|ru|This needs cleaning up: there's no definition line, and no particular reason to believe it's a prefix is provided}}

# {{gloss|With prepositions and pronouns '''не''' actually is a prefix, in spite of the fact that it is written separately.}}
#: {{m|ru|[[не́]] с [[кто|кем]]||from}} → {{m|ru|не́кем}}
#: {{m|ru|[[не́]] из [[что|чего́]]||from}} → {{m|ru|не́чего}}

===Interjection===
{{head|ru|interjection}}

# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} [[no]] {{gl|used to show disagreement or negation}}
#: {{syn|ru|нет|q1=standard and common term}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Помо́жешь мне? '''Не''', да́же и не ду́май.|t=Will you help me? No, don't even think about it.}}

===See also===
* {{l|ru|нет}}
* {{l|ru|ни}}
